  "description": "Motivation Sticker Set affirmation \nThis uplifting Motivation Sticker Set includes 6 cozy affirmation designs styled as cute pastel sticky notes with soft colors, gentle typography, and comforting messages. Each sticker features a positive reminder like “Small wins matter,” “Done is better than perfect,” and “Gentle progress counts,” designed to support mindfulness, productivity, and self-care.\nPerfect for planners, journals, laptops, scrapbooking, stickers sheets, digital planning, POD products, and printable decor, these designs follow a calm, modern, cozy aesthetic that resonates especially well with slow living, mental health, and productivity niches.\nThe stickers come in PNG format and are sized for both individual use and full sticker sheets,\nWhat’s included:\n6 motivational sticker designs\nSizes: 4″ x 4″ (individual) + 11″ x 8.5″ (sticker sheet)\nPNG format, high resolution\nClean white outline, sticker-ready",
